(from * go #south to #mine-entrance)

%% TSHAF
#shaft-room
(room *)
(name *)	Shaft Room
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a large room, in the middle of which is a small shaft
	descending through the floor into darkness below. To the west and the
	north are exits from this room. Constructed over the top of the shaft is
	a metal framework to which a heavy iron chain is attached.
(narrate failing to leave * #down)
	You wouldn't fit and would die if you could.
(from * go #west to #mine-entrance)
(from * go #north to #wooden-tunnel)

