%% LISTS
#stack-of-listings
(* is #in #tomb-of-the-unknown-implementer)
(name *)	stack of listings
(item *)
(readable *)
(flammable *)
(dict *)	paper list print listi stack lists listings
(* size is 70)
(appearance *)
	There is an enormous stack of line-printer paper here. It is barely
	readable.
(initial appearance *)
	There is a gigantic pile of line-printer output here. Although the paper
	once contained useful information, almost nothing can be distinguished
	now.
(descr *)
    <DEFINE FEEL-FREE \(LOSER\)
        <TELL \"FEEL FREE, CHOMPER!\">>
            ...
    The rest is, alas, unintelligible \(as were the implementers\).

